# identity_json.txtar — identity invariant (JSON).
#
# The identity query "." decode→encode produces byte-identical output
# to its input, and two consecutive runs produce byte-identical stdout.

nesdit-idempotent --query '.' in.json

-- in.json --
{"a":{"b":1,"c":2},"items":[{"x":10,"y":20},{"x":30}],"big":9007199254740993}
